[{"title":"厓门吊古四首 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"百万貔貅一壑中，后人空自说三忠。\n每疑木石衔精卫，时向烟波现白虹。\n燕市可堪仍履地，海灵谁复断孤篷。\n慈元旧殿今芜没，愁杀江门老钓翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40651,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门吊古四首 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"日日扁舟访海滨，莺花寥落度深春。\n驭戎异代俱无策，汉帝繇来自有神。\n荒树几行催蜀魄，怒涛千尺泣波臣。\n数乘此险惭明发，只恐微丹后古人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40652,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门吊古四首 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"往事苍茫不可寻，东风吹雨昼阴阴。\n精魂拟共湘波怨，遗恨长留越客吟。\n赖是圣朝回汉甸，只今邦计仗南琛。\n舂陵佳气中兴日，借取当年义士心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40653,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狱中步文丞相韵","author":"陈邦彦","text":"生涯少壮但传经，通籍才周两岁星。\n乡国愁看成陨箨，室家宁计问飘萍。\n万言旧疏还谁乙，五木严刑拚备丁。\n泉路若逢文信国，不知双眼可谁青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40654,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狱中自述","author":"陈邦彦","text":"去岁承恩桂海漘，何期国步倍多迍。\n室中自起金戈衅，天外俄飞铁骑尘。\n入梦翠华频想像，招携乌合每逡巡。\n经年辛苦惭何补，应识皇明有死臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40655,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狱中传闻张芷园遇害歌以吊之","author":"陈邦彦","text":"三百年来世泽孤，寥寥岭外数狂夫。\n邮筒每恨东西隔，鼎足那堪次第徂。\n人世谁与不死者，他时公等亦生乎。\n罗浮山下多琪树，休逐啼鹃带血呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40656,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樟树阻风 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"晓日乍瞳昽，惊波来自北。\n天气幸未寒，风威尔胡得。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40657,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樟树阻风 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"凉吹起青蘋，怒涛浮白马。\n舟人惯耐愁，倚棹长堤下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40658,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樟树阻风 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"片片帆南指，湝湝水北流。\n隔船人去蚤，前路也维舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40659,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樟树阻风 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"近市醉容易，长年唤不应。\n客心与江水，日夜向金陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40660,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上","author":"陈邦彦","text":"帆影宵仍远，山容午始开。\n水禽无意绪，飞去又飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40661,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅怀次林子同韵 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"客愁馀半榻，乡梦绕千峰。\n但见竿头日，不闻城上钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40662,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅怀次林子同韵 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"高斋夜说鬼，霍然消旅病。\n不奈谈深时，满目看飞镜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40663,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅怀次林子同韵 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"君今忆故园，归期亦全未。\n褚公髯如戟，閒杀丈夫气。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40664,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"古戍萧关远，空阶草露深。\n开帘时一望，何处捣衣心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40665,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"西凉知远近，梦里时尝到。\n度却绣窗前，已是西凉道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40666,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"乾鹊本多声，藑茅亦世情。\n见郎亲笔信，难道不分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40667,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"故里苧萝山，夫家吴淞水。\n合欢未煖席，牵心那如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西南七夕 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"为问银河事有无，宵深长自望黄姑。\n千家古驿离愁少，争向檐前戏网蛛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西南七夕 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"同舟端不负前期，沙际停桡坐语迟。\n想见故园瓜果熟，夜凉如水度秋嬉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶州旅舍书壁 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"湛湛芙蓉一水深，美人迟暮隔云岑。\n谁能千载留干羽，极目寒江送远砧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韶州旅舍书壁 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"如何旅梦太模糊，半逐乡关半入都。\n尽日江船向南去，相思还寄寸缄无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋储潭江上 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"章贡千峰入客船，储潭秋好夜无烟。\n来时刚拟金陵月，未到金陵月已圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋储潭江上 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"病后絺衣怯露寒，娟娟山月掩篷看。\n故园朋旧多相忆，何处更深独倚栏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋储潭江上 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"漫将杯酒佐馀酣，旅次新愁未惯谙。\n极目遥空秋一色，月明偏自炤江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅舍读壁间诗和者四人皆以重阳为感何此时独多客游耶余过此于重阳亦近矣漫书二绝和之后之大夫君子亦将有感于斯言 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"山村寥寂近重阳，挑逗诗肠与酒肠。\n采菊盈襜旋弃掷，不因踪迹在他乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅舍读壁间诗和者四人皆以重阳为感何此时独多客游耶余过此于重阳亦近矣漫书二绝和之后之大夫君子亦将有感于斯言 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"系马山椒饯夕阳，孤怀痴绝似柔肠。\n宸居近报开南极，客子宁当怨异乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自奉新抵芦潭舟中口号 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"豫章城下别同游，却度西山上小舟。\n一诺肯令惭季布，片言聊复借曹丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自奉新抵芦潭舟中口号 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"百里而遥一日过，匆匆为别饮无何。\n京华已愧严徐晚，城内从教卓郑多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自奉新抵芦潭舟中口号 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"山村水郭夜频谙，信宿官衙梦颇酣。\n孤棹更从深树出，暮云斜月落江潭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自奉新抵芦潭舟中口号 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"故园年少爱风筝，入夜轻弦