"明"}},{"title":"辛巳元日自题小像因怀邓玉叔 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"鲜原嘉卉正纷披，双鬓应凭笑猬皮。\n最是丹青描不尽，芳心无那寄江蓠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛巳元日自题小像因怀邓玉叔 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"风流安石恋攀跻，比拟年华渐欲齐。\n却较东山输一着，许来声伎不曾携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛巳元日自题小像因怀邓玉叔 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"故人相约访蓬茅，岁旦披图一解嘲。\n同乐也须吾党在，冶城何似凤城坳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟春廿七夜集写叶山房赏灯奉和云淙先生大韵 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"九十春光未有涯，锦堂留赏兴逾佳。\n拚教晓漏催银烛，纤月犹能炤六街。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟春廿七夜集写叶山房赏灯奉和云淙先生大韵 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"槛外新红取次增，兰缸点缀复相仍。\n酒酣试倚前檐望，道是花枝是綵灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟春廿七夜集写叶山房赏灯奉和云淙先生大韵 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"冒雪寻芳醉几回，买舟重见碧桃开。\n名园未厌看灯久，待熟池头树树梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孟春廿七夜集写叶山房赏灯奉和云淙先生大韵 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"玄云初结暗笼纱，雨脚风梢剪剪斜。\n漫向中原歌倬汉，天南今有雒如花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠何时乂","author":"陈邦彦","text":"风送棠梨五辆轻，莺花如笑度江城。\n投来片刺休容易，处土当年字正平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其一","author":"陈邦彦","text":"浮云漠漠罥烟丝，分手苍茫自一时。\n最是萍踪浑不定，相思人在水之湄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其二","author":"陈邦彦","text":"入望壶冰炤眼寒，浈江南下路漫漫。\n山城浪有逢迎喜，都向游人镜里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其三","author":"陈邦彦","text":"相将杯酒饯春阳，弦月纤絺爱晚凉。\n何事倦游人已远，空劳车骑拟临邛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其四","author":"陈邦彦","text":"柔绪萦纡半似痴，酒坛花坞坐迟迟。\n西风无赖催装急，一度扁舟也自疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其五","author":"陈邦彦","text":"天南何处郑公乡，绛帐当年马季长。\n孤剑蒯缑双鬓短，只应惭见旧宫墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其六","author":"陈邦彦","text":"旧约经年意未平，溯洄犹自系离情。\n更谁天外传消息，闷倚吴钩愧请缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三水归舟有怀 其七","author":"陈邦彦","text":"云树无端恁见欺，夹溪梅雨片帆移。\n何因一洗风烟净，重理兰舟访所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":40726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]